  "historyNote": "#741, eff 1-18-76; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; amd by #9924-A, eff 5-10-11, (paras (a)-(e), (f)(3), (g)-(k), & (m)-(o)); amd by #9924-B, eff 5-10-11, (paras (f)(1)-(2) & (l)); ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #11035-B, eff 2-11-16; ss by #12756, eff 4-10-19; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
